      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm in full agreement. It can be irritating when users come up to me without having a conversation with me, and imploring that I accept their friend request; but I believe that it will stop that social pressure if there is a pop-up that says \"This user is not accepting friend requests at this time\".",
